  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 3.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Si cacepollum advocet quod ei teloneum dedit, et ille neget, perneget ad Dei iudicum et in nulla alia lada.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he vouches the tax-gatherer to warranty [asserting] that he paid toll to him, and the latter denies it, he shall clear himself by the ordeal and by no other means of proof.</ab>
      </div>
